meta-industrial-gateway
=======================

Yocto BSP layer for the Industrial Edge Gateway Resilient Alert System
on BeagleBone Black (am335x).

Features
--------
  - Device tree configuration for DHT11 sensor, GPIO LED, and GPIO button
  - Kernel config fragment enabling GPIO-LEDs, GPIO-keys, IIO, and DHT11
  - Kernel patch for DHT11 sensors reporting decimal temperature values

Dependencies
------------
  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
  layers: meta, meta-poky, meta-yocto-bsp
  branch: scarthgap

Adding the layer to your build
------------------------------
  bitbake-layers add-layer meta-industrial-gateway

Building the image
------------------
  bitbake industrial-gateway-image
